This licence covers the contents of this repository as a collection, and any
contribution for which no narrower licence is stated.

Individual entries may carry their own terms. Every record's `provenance` block
names the actual sources, licence and attribution for that entry's data and
assets, and where it states terms for an entry, those terms govern that entry.

Much of the underlying data is United States government work in the public
domain (NASA, JPL, NAIF, USGS). Public-domain data does not become restricted
by appearing here. Texture and model assets are frequently third-party works
under their own licences, which are named per entry and must be honoured.

Contributors: by opening a pull request you confirm that you have the right to
contribute the content, and that its stated licence and attribution are
accurate.
